  <text>
    <body>
      <p>其後芸州の船より小蝶丸ニ乗かへ須崎を発し、十月九日ニ大坂に参り申候。則今朝上京仕候」此頃京坂のもよふ以前とハよ程相変、日<g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-831-864">〻</g><seg source="#source-864-873">にごて</seg><choice source="#source-873-879"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-879-930">と仕候得ども、世の中は乱んとして中</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-930-963">〻</g><seg source="#source-963-966">不</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-966-978">レ</note><seg source="#source-978-1005">乱ものにて候と、皆</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-1005-1038">〻</g>申居候事に御座候」先は今日までぶじなる事、幸便ニ申上候。謹言<g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-1128-1161">〻</g><seg source="#source-1161-1166">。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1166-1228" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1187-1199">十月九日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1199-1228" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1217-1228">梅太郎</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1228-1254" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1249-1254">〆</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1254-1295" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1275-1295">上町本一丁目</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1295-1363" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1316-1331">坂本権平様</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1331-1363" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1349-1363">坂本龍馬</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1363-1393" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1384-1393">御直披</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
